<title>JAPAN: Yamato International -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yamato International -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.19		vs	   11.96</p>
<p> Operating	  209    million	  vs	  168    million</p>
<p> Current	     69    million	  vs	  165    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 455    million	  vs	prft 154 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 14.91 yen	  vs     prft 5.06 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     31 million	  vs	  31 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yamato International Inc is a wholesaler of fashion wear.</p>
